---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import WhatsAppFloat from '../../components/WhatsAppFloat.astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Article",
  "headline": "How to Use Quotex Bot — Complete Beginner Tutorial 2026",
  "description": "Step-by-step tutorial for setting up and using the Quotex auto trading bot Chrome extension.",
  "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "QuotexBot" },
  "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "QuotexBot", "logo": { "@type": "ImageObject", "url": "https://quottexbot.com/logo.png" } },
  "datePublished": "2026-06-10",
  "dateModified": "2026-06-10"
};
---

<Layout
  title="How to Use Quotex Bot — Complete Beginner Tutorial 2026"
  description="Complete step-by-step beginner tutorial for Quotex Bot Chrome extension. Learn how to install, configure trading sequences, set risk management and start automated martingale trading on QXBroker in 2026."
  keywords="how to use quotex bot, how to trade on quotex, quotex trading guide, quotex registration, quotex demo account, quotex trading course, quotex tips"
  schema={schema}
>
  <Header />

  <article class="blog-article">
    <div class="container blog-container">
      <header class="article-header">
        <div class="article-meta">
          <span class="badge badge-blue">Tutorial</span>
          <span class="article-date">June 10, 2026 · 6 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h1>How to Use Quotex Bot — Complete Beginner Tutorial</h1>
        <p class="article-lead">A complete step-by-step tutorial for beginners on how to set up and use the Quotex automated trading bot Chrome extension. From installation to your first automated trade in under 5 minutes.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="article-content">

        <h2>What You Need Before Starting</h2>
        <ul class="article-list">
          <li>Google Chrome browser (any recent version)</li>
          <li>A Quotex or QXBroker account (free demo works)</li>
          <li>5 minutes of setup time</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="article-callout info">
          <strong>💡 Good News:</strong> You do NOT need a live account or real money to start. The Quotex demo account comes with virtual $10,000 — perfect for testing.
        </div>

        <h2>Step 1: Install Quotex Bot Chrome Extension</h2>
        <p>Open your Chrome browser and visit the Chrome Web Store. Search for "Quotex Bot" or use the direct install link below.</p>
        <p>Click <strong>Add to Chrome</strong> → then click <strong>Add Extension</strong> in the popup. The bot installs in seconds.</p>
        <p>After installation, you'll see the 🤖 robot icon in your Chrome toolbar. If it's hidden, click the puzzle piece icon (🧩) and pin Quotex Bot to make it always visible.</p>
        <div style="margin:20px 0;">
          <a href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/dbdhnfbjkakhilkkaoemgldcikboakdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">🚀 Install Quotex Bot Free</a>
        </div>

        <h2>Step 2: Open Quotex Demo Account</h2>
        <p>Go to <strong>qxbroker.com/en/demo-trade</strong> in Chrome. If you don't have an account, register for free — no deposit required for demo.</p>
        <p>Click the 🤖 Quotex Bot icon in your toolbar. The bot sidebar will open on the right side of your browser, showing all the controls.</p>

        <div class="article-callout warning">
          <strong>⚠️ Important:</strong> Make sure the Trades panel at the bottom right of Quotex is always visible. The bot reads your trade results from there — never hide or minimize it while the bot is running.
        </div>

        <h2>Step 3: Choose Your Strategy</h2>
        <p>In the sidebar you'll see four preset strategy buttons:</p>
        <ul class="article-list">
          <li><strong>🟢 Conservative (Low Risk)</strong> — Best for beginners. Uses 1,2,4,8 amounts with 4-step sequence</li>
          <li><strong>🟡 Balanced (Medium Risk)</strong> — Most popular. Uses 1,2,4,8,17,35,73,151 with 8-step sequence</li>
          <li><strong>🔴 Aggressive (High Risk)</strong> — Uses triple-up amounts for faster recovery</li>
          <li><strong>⚡ Turbo (Very High Risk)</strong> — Extreme multiplier for large accounts only</li>
        </ul>
        <p>For your first time, click <strong>Conservative</strong>. This will auto-fill the Trading Sequence and Investment Amounts fields.</p>

        <h2>Step 4: Set Time Interval</h2>
        <p>Select how long each trade lasts from the Time Interval dropdown. For demo trading, we recommend starting with <strong>5 seconds</strong> or <strong>30 seconds</strong> — shorter intervals mean faster feedback on how the bot performs.</p>

        <h2>Step 5: Optional — Set Risk Management</h2>
        <p>Before starting, you can optionally set auto-stop conditions:</p>
        <ul class="article-list">
          <li>Check <strong>🎯 Take profit at</strong> and enter an amount (e.g. $50) — bot stops when you hit this profit</li>
          <li>Check <strong>🛑 Stop loss at</strong> and enter an amount (e.g. $20) — bot stops when you lose this much</li>
          <li>Check <strong>⏰ Stop after</strong> and enter minutes (e.g. 30) — bot stops after this time</li>
        </ul>
        <p>These are optional but highly recommended, especially when starting out.</p>

        <h2>Step 6: Click Start Trading!</h2>
        <p>Click the big green <strong>Start Trading</strong> button. The bot will immediately:</p>
        <ul class="article-list">
          <li>Set the time interval on the Quotex page</li>
          <li>Set the investment amount</li>
          <li>Click the UP or DOWN button according to your sequence</li>
          <li>Wait for the trade result</li>
          <li>Adjust the next investment amount (advance on loss, reset on win)</li>
          <li>Repeat the process automatically</li>
        </ul>

        <p>You'll see the live stats bar appear on the Quotex page showing Profit, Loss, Net, and Trade count in real time.</p>

        <h2>Step 7: Monitor and Learn</h2>
        <p>Watch your first session carefully. Notice how the bot:</p>
        <ul class="article-list">
          <li>Advances the investment amount after a loss</li>
          <li>Resets to the first amount after a win</li>
          <li>Follows your direction sequence consistently</li>
          <li>Updates stats in real time after every trade</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Upgrading to Live Trading</h2>
        <p>Once you're confident with demo results, you can upgrade to live trading. Click the Subscribe button in the sidebar to get the $20/month Gumroad subscription. Use the same email in the extension to verify your subscription automatically.</p>

        <div class="article-cta">
          <h3>Ready to Start? It's Free on Demo!</h3>
          <p>Install Quotex Bot and start your first automated trading session in under 5 minutes. No credit card, no deposit, no risk.</p>
          <a href="https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/dbdhnfbjkakhilkkaoemgldcikboakdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">🚀 Add to Chrome — Free</a>
        </div>

        <h2>Common Questions from Beginners</h2>

        <h3>The bot placed a trade in the wrong direction — is that normal?</h3>
        <p>Yes! The bot follows a fixed direction sequence (e.g. up, down, up, down) regardless of market conditions. The martingale strategy relies on money management, not direction prediction.</p>

        <h3>The bot seems slow — what should I do?</h3>
        <p>Make sure your internet connection is stable. The bot waits for each trade to close before placing the next one. Shorter time intervals (5-10s) will feel faster.</p>

        <h3>I see "Could not find trading buttons" error</h3>
        <p>This means you're not on the Quotex trading page, or the page hasn't fully loaded. Refresh the page and make sure you're on the demo-trade or live trading page.</p>

        <div class="article-nav">
          <a href="/blog/quotex-martingale-strategy-guide" class="btn btn-secondary">← Martingale Guide</a>
          <a href="/blog/quotex-bot-on-mobile" class="btn btn-secondary">Next: Mobile Guide →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer />
  <WhatsAppFloat />
</Layout>

<style is:global>
.blog-article { padding: 60px 0 100px; }
.blog-container { max-width: 800px; }
.article-header { margin-bottom: 48px; padding-bottom: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.article-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.article-date { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
.article-header h1 { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.article-lead { font-size: 18px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
.article-content h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; margin: 40px 0 16px; }
.article-content h3 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin: 28px 0 12px; }
.article-content p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.article-callout { padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 24px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }
.article-callout.info { background: rgba(0,176,255,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(0,176,255,0.2); color: var(--accent2); }
.article-callout.warning { background: rgba(255,214,0,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,214,0,0.2); color: var(--gold); }
.article-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin: 16px 0 24px; list-style: none; }
.article-list li { display: flex; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
.article-list li::before { content: "→"; color: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; }
.article-cta { background: rgba(0,230,118,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(0,230,118,0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; text-align: center; }
.article-cta h3 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.article-cta p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 15px; }
.article-nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
</style>
